# 🧠 AI Workflow

The application dynamically creates specialized AI reviewers depending on the uploaded content.

Example reviewers include:

* Content Strategist
* SEO Expert
* Copywriting Coach
* Marketing Specialist
* UX Reviewer
* Behavioral Psychology Reviewer
* Social Media Expert
* Branding Consultant

Each reviewer provides:

* Scores
* Detailed reasoning
* Actionable recommendations
* Improvement opportunities

